title Spike 22c: orders for later
about Shift queues orders. Four tanks are given a route of four waypoints at once and drive it corner by corner; an engineer is given three generators and an extractor at once and builds them in turn. Nobody gives a second order.

scenario economy
bases blue
bot blue off
bot red off
clip 0..2400
speed 3
camera 100,282 165

at 0 spawn blue tank 4 at 100,300 radius 4
at 1 select blue tank within 20 of 100,300 as column
at 1 select blue engineer max 1 as crew
at 2 move column 160,300
at 2 move column 160,340 queued
at 2 move column 110,340 queued
at 2 move column 110,300 queued
at 2 build crew generator at 70,240
at 2 queue crew generator at 70,230
at 2 queue crew generator at 80,225
at 2 queue crew extractor at 46,229

at 600 select blue tank within 10 of 160,340 as corner
at 601 expect corner alive >= 4          # at the far corner, on the way round
# Observed: the column is back at its start after the loop; the engineer
# put up all three generators and the extractor without another order.
at 2399 select blue tank within 12 of 110,300 as home
at 2400 expect home alive >= 4
at 2400 expect blue generators >= 3
at 2400 expect blue extractors >= 1
